<title>USA: Schroder Wertheim names Cohen as director.</title>
<headline>Schroder Wertheim names Cohen as director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it named Sanford Cohen as a director in the power industry unit of its investment banking department.</p>
<p>Cohen most recently ran Shoreline Utility Advisors.</p>
<p>Schroder Wertheim is a unit of Schroders Plc.</p>
